  "scope": [
    "Remove the remaining current-tree local-environment text findings from retained self-host artifacts and first-party fixtures without rewriting Git history or breaking pinned adapter provenance; record an exact-digest reviewed disposition for the single vendored Archify fixture."
  ],
  "acceptance_criteria": [
    "A deterministic stale-safe operation normalizes only inventoried retained artifacts, retains no matched values, records before and after digests, and is idempotent.",
    "First-party fixtures keep their security-test semantics without literal maintainer-shaped paths, private IPv4 addresses, or private Tailnet hostnames.",
    "The pinned Archify source remains byte-for-byte intact and usable while the exact reviewed fixture disposition is independently auditable and cannot excuse credentials or unrelated paths.",
    "The public repository and package audit report zero blocked text findings and zero unresolved text review findings; reviewed binary files remain an explicit separate review boundary."
  ],
